{
  "job_B23.3.1.4_20261117_183126": {
    "chunk_text": "On anre nihte ealdne monan \u00fe\u00e6t cild, \u00fe\u00e6t swa bi\u00f0 acenned, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 liflic. On II nihte aldne monan, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 seoc & sicle. On III nihte aldne monan, se leofa\u00f0 lange. On IIII, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 on wur\u00f0unge geond feola \u00f0eode. On V nihte aldne monan, \u00fe\u00e6t geong swelta\u00f0. On VI nihte, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 lang lifes ges\u00e6lig. On VII nihte ealdne monan, se leofe\u00f0 lange on wur\u00f0unge. On VIII nihte, \u00fe\u00e6t iung swelta\u00f0. On IX nihte aldne, se bi\u00f0 frecenlice acenned. On X, se bi\u00f0 \u00ferowere. On XI nihte aldne monan, se bi\u00f0 landes oferg\u00e6nge. On XII nihte aldne monan, se bi\u00f0 on allum \u00feingum wur\u00f0ful. On XIII nihte, se bi\u00f0 \u00e6wfest & rihtwis. On XIIII nihte in allum \u00feingum he bi\u00f0 welgetyd. On XV, se geong swelta\u00f0. On XVI se bi\u00f0 in allum \u00feingum nytwyr\u00f0e. On XVII nihte, se bi\u00f0 sona gewiten. On XVIII nihte, se bi\u00f0 earm & geswingful on his life. On XIX, on weor\u00f0unge. On XX, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 sona gefaren. On XXI, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 on godre weor\u00f0unge. On XXII, unheore feohtling. On XXIII, se bi\u00f0 \u00feeof & scea\u00f0e. On XXIIII, se bi\u00f0 geswingful on his life. On XXV, se bi\u00f0 halsum in his lif. On XXVI, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 weorces g\u00e6lsa. On XXVII, se bi\u00f0 on frecnum \u00feingum acenned..",
